<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dial Corp resumed with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dial Corp resumed with buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Carol Werner said she resumed coverage of Dial Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no question that Dial has had its problems over the last two years, but we believe that the company's new, aggressive management team is committed to showing that Dial is still a player in its markets,&quot; Werner said in a research note.</p>
<p>She said Salomon's 1996 full year estimate was $0.72. Earnings are expected to grow to $0.88 in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 5/8 at 14-1/8.</p>
</text>
